      en: ["The remains of old colonial buildings along a narrow lane in the heart of Nassau.", "Located in the Caribbean island nation of the Bahamas.", "The region is marked by a tropical-maritime climate.", "Accessible via the national transport network of the islands.", "Plays a role in the local economy and culture."]
